OL,3,GNEWSAIrish president meets Swinney at
OL,4,Astart of four-day visit to Scotland
OL,5,
OL,6,FIreland's President Catherine Connolly
OL,7,Fhas met First Minister John Swinney at
OL,8,Fthe start of a four-day visit to
OL,9,FScotland.
OL,11,FSwinney was joined by his wife as he
OL,12,Fgreeted Connolly and her husband before
OL,13,Fa meeting at Bute House.
OL,15,FLast November the SNP leader became the
OL,16,Ffirst overseas leader to meet the
OL,17,Fpresident, at her official residence in
OL,18,FDublin, following her inauguration.
OL,20,FDuring her time in Scotland Connolly
OL,21,Fwill receive an honorary fellowship
OL,22,Ffrom the Royal Society of Edinburgh.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
